<title>JAPAN: Yasuda up on business cooperation report.</title>
<headline>Yasuda up on business cooperation report.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yasuda Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd shares firmed in early Wednesday morning trade on a report that it, Fuji Bank Ltd and Yasuda Mutual Life Insurance Co (Yasuda Life) would strengthen their capital ties and business cooperation ahead of Japan's &quot;Big Bang&quot;, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0104 GMT, Yasuda Trust was up nine yen at 424. Fuji Bank was unchanged at 1,650 yen.</p>
